{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Song Buddy 是一款把歌曲分離成人聲、鼓、低音結他、結他、鋼琴等多個音軌的練習工具，適合希望聽清指定樂器、跟隨演奏及反覆鑽研段落的樂手。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-109.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線分離音軌專注練習</h2>\n<p>Song Buddy 以裝置端人工智能把歌曲分離成最多 6 個音軌，可隔離樂器、靜音人聲或低音結他後跟隨演奏，支援不變調減速、升降調、循環段落及節拍器。內建半音調音器與每軌音量、靜音、獨奏控制；接上樂器或麥克風，可使用音箱模擬與殘響。全程離線，適合轉錄、練習及即興合奏。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-360-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-361-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-362-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-363-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-364-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-365-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Song Buddy</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/song-buddy/id6770318682?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T21:00:36.468433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:33.275870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:24.459340+00:00","content_hash":"b7c21e64d8dbb9469c9adfa71cf8a62907e2c22f59a441188250062ef743a4b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}